Elon Musk=E2=80=99s orbital ownership

Elon Musk=E2=80=99s SpaceX is the single largest satellite operator in the =
world, larger than any government space bureau. The life-threatening conseq=
uences of that dominance and centralization of power are on full display. O=
ne man is in charge of global, vital infrastructure, which is thumbing the =
scales in the war on Ukraine.

SpaceX=E2=80=99s internet service was throttled in Ukraine amid a series of=
 devastating attacks by Russia last week, leaving the country extremely vul=
nerable. The US government controls StarShield, the satellite internet serv=
ice produced by SpaceXSI for the Pentagon, which is what Ukraine relies on.=
