olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Anthropic filed for an initial public offe=
ring on the US stock market Monday, ahead of what it slated to be one of th=
e biggest debuts in financial history. The company withheld a valuation fro=
m its filing with US financial regulators, but investors and analysts are v=
aluing the AI firm at north of $1.5tn.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The numbers are jaw-dropping and speak to =
the speed of the AI boom. Anthropic was founded in 2021. That=E2=80=99s onl=
y five years ago, yet already it has grown to a valuation bigger than 98% o=
f the top companies on the US stock market.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Anthropic detailed rapidly rising revenue =
in the prospectus: $41m in 2023, $386m in 2024, $4.585bn in 2025 (a yearly =
increase of more than 1,000%), then $16.286bn in the first six months of 20=
26 alone. The company disclosed that, as of the end of June, it had raised =
$141.1bn.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Despite the increasing revenue, Anthropic =
disclosed a net loss of $80bn for the first half of 2026, mostly due to a o=
ne-time $72.4bn charge. It lost $36bn the year prior.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Anthropic=E2=80=99s initial public offerin=
g will rock the US stock market and likely global markets as well. The infu=
sion of at least a trillion dollars in value is likely to influence investo=
r appetites for every kind of technology stock. That a company of that magn=
itude can be spun up in five years speaks to the breakneck pace of AI devel=
opment and financing. Despite calls to slow down from Anthropic=E2=80=99s C=
EO Dario Amodei, the artificial intelligence industry is still defined by a=
 careening intensity that=E2=80=99s taking the world=E2=80=99s finances alo=
ng for the ride.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Such rapid growth demonstrates an upside f=
or company founders for now. They can build a business that creates life-ch=
anging, globe-spanning wealth in just half a decade.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">For the rest of us, the speed of growth sp=
ells precarity. Anthropic, a company that could determine the direction of =
the entire US economy, is going public before a baby born in its founding y=
ear has started kindergarten.</p>
